{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>風扇加1物降溫效果超越冷氣？做多1步更涼快+慳電 即睇技巧！｜一到夏天不少人都因為長開冷氣而令電費急升，不過其實除了開冷氣之外，只要開風扇時加1樣物件亦可增加降溫效果，方法簡單林超英都用得！</p><p>風扇加濕毛巾效果超越冷氣？</p><p>台灣Youtube頻道「妙招小哥」分享風扇降溫妙招，只要用濕毛巾再配合風扇，就可以提升風扇降溫效果。步驟只需要將一條毛巾弄濕之後擰至半乾，再放入雪櫃冰格冷藏。約20分鐘後，將毛巾拿出再攤放在風扇上即可令風扇吹出涼風，無須開冷氣連林超英都可以用！</p><figure><img alt=\"風扇加濕毛巾提升降溫效果 (妙招小哥)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240809/898643307683385344810324.png/mKCRvlzGdNso61WC4csmleTjOFEvOyvbX-TMwF_kzMA\"/><figcaption>風扇加濕毛巾提升降溫效果 (妙招小哥)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"準備一條毛巾(妙招小哥)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240809/898644481367085056497832.png/9N_7jWyapBufumpaeE9e-as4YyW78Efaa2FOEWthThE\"/><figcaption>準備一條毛巾(妙招小哥)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"將一條毛巾弄濕(妙招小哥)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240809/898644484110290944490267.png/yPtjpkEmLK39XPJsNkzxmDK0X3AZ_204xiOrs8Yjq7M\"/><figcaption>將一條毛巾弄濕(妙招小哥)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"之後擰至半乾！(妙招小哥)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240809/898644486593449984197306.png/vhYzZK8mmsvLMBZTC8UNLSdj2F6oAecVfCNNFXwjTRU\"/><figcaption>之後擰至半乾！(妙招小哥)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"再放入雪櫃冰格冷藏。約20分鐘後，將毛巾拿出再攤放在風扇上即可令風扇吹出涼風，無須開冷氣連林超英都可以用。(妙招小哥)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240809/898644488980140032802531.png/1L-8fod3GybAXBLGX-f23Bngh0BG5TWCnYQX5J2EF-Q\"/><figcaption>再放入雪櫃冰格冷藏。約20分鐘後，將毛巾拿出再攤放在風扇上即可令風扇吹出涼風，無須開冷氣連林超英都可以用。(妙招小哥)</figcaption></figure><p>淺色毛巾效果更佳</p><p>除了妙招小哥之外，英國洗衣公司「Laundryheap」創辦人Deyan Dimitrov亦曾分享類似的降溫方法，只要將濕毛巾雪凍後掛在氣流進入室內的入口，例如窗口或門口，即可有效降溫，Deyan解釋因為當毛巾表面水分蒸發時，就會進入室內空氣並變成冷空氣，在所以無須開冷氣都可以有效降溫。不過要留意的是，確保毛巾乾淨，以防令室內有異味。另外使用淺色毛巾可以避免毛巾在陽光下吸熱，效果更好。</p><figure><img alt=\"淺色毛巾效果更佳 (資料圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240809/898645092489760768847635.jpeg/Z-7YNkNRR4HuQHyQjAiT7RPvAvTJO7SzU-kOIFPpDiA\"/><figcaption>淺色毛巾效果更佳 (資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>風扇清潔技巧</p><p>如果想風扇出風更好，可以定期清潔風扇以免被灰塵阻礙出風。</p><p>風扇8步清潔教學👇👇</p><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982130373234688358691.jpeg/MbbURCVwu-gXzWnt1GjNYGqJTftrNvzxhyc0c4cnNHM\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982132801867776457862.jpeg/Hqyqvty5AXPI-CZDeazl10i_GLfibasQl53w5Jed8OQ\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982135272443904105234.jpeg/RshsR2pPJrhr2hlA5rrQSy5kIodGkfXEOwtZEzsLWRM\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982137633968128741650.jpeg/ub_YEZHLmcic4cgcUJLlja0asInUPJFOwPl1FcD5dRU\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982139987103744295067.jpeg/JtOagBTz_W-eYfAZGqOSuJk0XSLVPKF_FWOEbxVjhG8\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982142235381760296057.jpeg/fOjhlIJchltulGCdRcYbkdBHCsaSghzayjUVvMo1Fbw\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982144714346496162038.jpeg/EUtFwzDPd3tQGc_Gbqd2Su2HZa37XBZW3J023tydNt4\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982147092647936587023.jpeg/y0AK0-waJAaLdcSZcRBGwBMkTTPqBlCcmPTZ3Jj02dw\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220413/590982149605167104867510.jpeg/pu4k1tsXgAjJwMZi_7y1hmZUt3M7XG_dyACCksgAgpI\"/><figcaption>有葉電風扇 8 Steps 清潔教學</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T07:39:49.157432+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":791,"images":15,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}